he output stream is unaffected.\n\nI removed my scratch artifacts (`cbuild/`, symbol lists); `c_src/` is unmodified. Deliverables are `translation/Cargo.toml` (`crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`), `translation/src/lib.rs`, and `translation/Cargo.lock`; `cargo build --release` succeeds from clean with no warnings.","ttft_ms":2749,"ttft_stream_ms":2358,"time_to_request_ms":56,"type":"result","duration_ms":235766,"uuid":"450e43a8-9f27-406b-851f-f0b471ed3bf8","queued_turn_count":0}
